}"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"table-of-contents"},{"id":"64f7d14","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"06deb41"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"f5cfe25","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>It’s 2023 and the best thing any website owner can learn is how to stay in the competitive edge.</p><p>In this post, I am going to show you 17 cool technique to improve your SEO rankings in 2023.</p><p>These are techniques that I have used and found them to be super helpful. Indeed, these techniques helped me to grow my website’s organic traffic by 58.92% within the previous year.</p><p>So if you are the guy who needs the smartest ways to quickly boost their <a href="https://onlinemarketinghelp.co.uk/ultimate-wordpress-seo-guide-for-beginners/">website SEO</a> rankings in 2023 and thereafter, this is the guide for you.</p><p>Let’s take a look.</p>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"5bdbc1c"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"9ab51aa","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Boost Your Website’s Loading Speed ","header_size":"h3","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"a5cd89e"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"acd185f","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>This technique is as old as they come. But it’s still as relevant in 2023. Actually, slow internet tops the list of the most annoying tech problems. So you don’t want to be caught in the same maze.</p><p>As such, how quickly or slowly your site will load directly affects your rankings. This has also been stressed on by Google Webmaster. In short, there is no escape when it comes to gunning the best loading speeds.</p><p>A new study has also shown that the pages that tend to rank on the first page often load faster compared to the ones that load at the bottom of the pack.</p><p>As such, it is very clear that if you want to <strong><u>rank better on Google SERPs</u></strong>, your website should lead pretty quickly.</p><p>Use the Google analytic tool to find out how fast you’re your website’s page will actually load at any given click.</p><p>And if you intend to dig even deeper and sort out the mess, then you can also test your page on the <a href="http://WebPageTest.org" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">WebPageTest.org</a>.</p><p>This way, you can easily boost the speed page/ loading time of your website page easily and in turn have a great about turn on rankings.</p><p>Here are some other tips that you can follow to boost the speed or loading time of your website’s page.</p><ul><li>Compressing Website Images</li><li>Choose a better website host</li><li>Reduce the file size of your webpage</li><li>Delete any unnecessary third party scripts</li></ul><p>With that said, let us get to the next <a href="https://onlinemarketinghelp.co.uk/creating-an-effective-search-engine-optimization-strategy-seo-in-2021/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEO strategy</a> that will be of help in 2023 and far beyond.</p>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"871eb3e"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1985021","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Get Your Website on Featured Snippets ","header_size":"h3","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"5bc87c1"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"4d07dae","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Over the past few years, featured snippets have become quite an influential option for those who intend to rank.</p><p>They are the new trend and seems like many experts are finally waking up to this new realization for SEO ranks.</p><p>To use featured snippets, you can use the “Snippet Bait.”</p><p>This is a new strategy that many experts are using to rank.</p><p>Here is how the strategy works:</p>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"3565c38"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"9e5fa2b","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Step I: Find a keyword that you are already ranking for.","header_size":"h4","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":23,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"d6bf25e"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"6cb8a45","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>This is important in this way. 99.58% of the most featured snippets will come from the first page SERPs.</p><p>As such, anyone that appears on the second page have almost zero chance of being featured on any snippet.</p><p>So go with a keyword that you have ranked so that you can easily find a featured snippet on the same.</p>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"1545a61"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"b6682a8","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Step II: Now look for the featured snippet in top of SERPs","header_size":"h4","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":23,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"fd72244"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"266ea82","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>To do this, you need to start by identifying the type of snippet that you are looking at. This is key.</p><ul><li>Is it a definition snippet (answers the question of “what”)</li><li>Is it a listing snippet (lists a number of tools or techniques “top 7 marketing tools”)</li><li>Is it a table snippet (gives features, or prices)</li></ul><p>Now you can add a snippet of <a href="https://onlinemarketinghelp.co.uk/web-content-writing/">content to the website page</a>. Make sure the content is designed to fit perfectly on the intended snippet box.</p><p>That’s how the snippet bait works.</p>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"d343ffd"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"0cdef37","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Target High Commercial Intent Keywords ","header_size":"h3","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"7e9d40d"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"9b1f1ff","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Most people, when they start up, they often focus selectively 100% on the keyword search volume.</p><p>That it okay, but it is not conclusive. When it comes to <u>keyword research</u>, there are so many things that you should focus on.</p><p>One of them is the commercial content. To determine this, ask yourself how much the Google Ads advertisers are spending on the clicks.</p><p>You will realize that a keyword may not get many searches. However, when you look at its CPC, you may notice well over $25.00, this is a clear indication that the traffic that this keyword gets is actually made up of legit buyers.</p><p>Focusing on the high commercial intent keywords is, therefore, very important. It will also leave you with superior results.</p>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"155e162"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"04eb38f","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Improve Overall Dwell Time: Use this Simple Step ","header_size":"h3","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"c333ed5"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"9c19f36","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>What makes <u>Dwell Time</u> a <a href="https://onlinemarketinghelp.co.uk/googles-200-plus-ranking-tricks-the-complete-guide-for-2021/">vital Google Ranking factor</a>?</p><p>Here is the thing, if a website visitor quickly bounces off your page and goes back to click a competitors page, it could only mean one thing.</p><p>You aren’t offering them what they need – but the competitor is.</p><p>In short, Google will take one clear message home. Visitors hate that page. In turn, the page will suffer when it comes to Google ranking on subsequent searches.</p><p>Once they down-rank your page, it might take more time that you’d anticipate to put it back on to the map.</p><p>So what can you do?</p><p>Instead, you should lower your <u>bounce rates</u>.</p><p>There are tons of techniques that you can use to minimize your bounce rates as much as you can.</p><p>They include the following:</p><ul><li>Use Videos</li><li>Embedding videos in your page makes the page more interactive.</li><li>It helps the visitors to follow your content better and to remain glued for a longer time.</li><li>As such, embedding videos in your page will add up for better bounce rates.</li></ul>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"aac96af"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"3cc64d2","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"EXAMPLE","header_size":"h4","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":23,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"4f38ba4"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"d1eb6f1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Apart from that, here are other tips that you can also use to minimize bounce rates and improve your overall ranking of the SERPs.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Boost page load time</strong></li><li><strong>Use images</strong></li><li><strong>Focus on easy to use interface</strong></li></ul>","text_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"300","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"4668068"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","align":"left"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"b89722c","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"<u>BONUS</u>: Download 3 Case Studies that Increased Website Profit 132x! ","align":"center","size":"md","icon_indent":{"unit":"px","size":17,"sizes":[]},"wunderwp_presets":null,"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":23,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","text_shadow_text_shadow_type":"yes","button_text_color":"#ffffff","background_color":"#3A4347","hover_color":"#ffffff","button_background_hover_color":"#3A4347","border_border":"dotted","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"2","right":"2","bottom":"2","left":"2","isLinked":true},"border_color":"#3A4347","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"20","bottom":"15","left":"20","isLinked":false},"pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"19652a2"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"},{"id":"dd5ac47","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"814eb9b"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"db7db78","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Create the Linkable Assets ","header_size":"h3","title_color":"#3A4347","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_weight":"600","pa_condition_repeater":[{"_id":"154ba11"}],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"240d639","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>No one will link to your content.</strong></p><p><strong>Every website that’s looking to link will link for great sources.</strong></p><p><strong>There are many tips that you can use to achieve high quality sources.</strong></p>","text_color":"#3A4347","